rokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ISS-room_equipment-r0" target="ISS-issues-r2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="690" y="694.0"/><mxPoint x="690" y="198.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ISS-e3" value="duplicate of" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;startArrow=ERzeroToOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=12;endSize=12;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;strokeWidth=1.5;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ISS-issues-r0" target="ISS-issues-r17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1360" y="134.0"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="678.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ISS-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• FKs marked → users reference users.user_id (Login &amp;amp; Users page); not drawn to keep the diagram readable&lt;br&gt;• IDs AUTOINCREMENT, never reused (BR-01) · issues are never deleted (BR-02) · issue_updates is append-only: no UPDATE or DELETE (NFR-ISS-04)&lt;br&gt;• New issues start OPEN in an active classroom · room_equipment_id must be installed in that classroom (BR-21) · classroom and item cannot change later&lt;br&gt;• Allowed status moves only (BR-23): OPEN→ASSIGNED/REJECTED/DUPLICATE · ASSIGNED→IN_PROGRESS/REJECTED/DUPLICATE · IN_PROGRESS→RESOLVED · RESOLVED→IN_PROGRESS/CLOSED&lt;br&gt;• ASSIGNED and later need assigned_to · RESOLVED/CLOSED need resolution_notes, resolved_by, resolved_at · DUPLICATE needs duplicate_of_id → a root issue, not itself&lt;br&gt;• CLOSED, REJECTED, DUPLICATE are final: fields locked, no new comments · only is_repeat_problem can still be set on an original&lt;br&gt;• Not stored: overdue (view v_issues_overdue: unresolved AND target_date &amp;lt; today) · report count = 1 + duplicates (view v_issue_report_counts, FR-ISS-08)" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="880" width="1380" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>